                            {
                                "example_id": "8f883d6f-dd27-4b89-9c4c-00b09a9788ea",
                                "sense_id": "7bf32266-90d6-3e74-bfa5-17e3a775a63e",
                                "text": "Несмотря́ на необыкнове́нную си́лу физи́ческих спосо́бностей, он ра́за два в неде́лю страда́л от обжо́рства и ка́ждый ве́чер быва́л навеселе́.",
                                "translation": "Despite an extraordinarily strong constitution, he suffered twice a week or so from his gluttony and was in his cups every evening.",
                                "english": "Despite an extraordinarily strong constitution, he suffered twice a week or so from his gluttony and was in his cups every evening."
                            }
